{"id":"vod_lz_10946","vodId":"10946","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"成神之日","name_cn":"成神之日","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220425-1/9c8d8cfd565ff7a167335c2423d76462.jpg"},"summary":"成神阳太（花江夏树 配音）是一位非常平凡的男子高中生，正在享受他高中生涯里的最后一个暑假。一天，正在篮球场打球的阳太邂逅了一位名叫佐藤雏（佐仓绫音 配音）神秘少女，少女告诉了阳太一个惊人的消息——“30天后，世界就会毁灭”。                                                                     　　阳太收留了无家可归的雏，虽然对她的暴言半信半疑，但雏所展现出的准确的预知能力让阳太渐渐开始相信她所言非虚。个性沉稳成绩优异的伊座并杏子（石川由依 配音）、外表看似冷淡但实际上有着一副热心肠的国宝阿修罗（木村良平 配音）、总是懒懒散散大大咧咧的成神空（桑原由气 配音），雏很快就交到了一群好朋友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-25 19:27:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11860_e15ddd8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11862_496f8431/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11861_7960a35d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11863_1ac547a1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11865_9e7a81d6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11864_0e5b0125/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11866_580c1e21/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11869_89205c93/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11868_78ab413f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11867_50cc5185/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11871_5727d8b1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220425/11870_d091fc1c/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:07.280Z"}